[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0010","text":"雾子，拍摄很顺利。\n动作做得很优美。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0020","text":"哇……\n谢谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0030","text":"你……一直在看着我吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0040","text":"当然了。之前练的走台步，\n还有各种训练，成果都出来了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0050","text":"你一直在很努力嘛。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0060","text":"不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0070","text":"因为制作人……\n一直在……帮我好多……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0080","text":"我也……能回报你……\n就好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0090","text":"不不，我已经收到很多回报了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20800300_02_0100","text":"呵呵……"}]
